  "question": {
    "text": "A number equal to <math><mn>4</mn></math> times of the mean and a frequency equal to <math><mi>k</mi></math> is inserted&nbsp;in the data of <math><mi>n</mi></math> observations. If the new mean is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> times the old mean, then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6.5",
  "solution": {
